            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "chawley333"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I make this as a dip and its fabulous! Reminds me of boursin, but homemade. I usually use ritz crackers and it is gone in minutes!! Thanks for the great idea!",
            "datePublished": "2013-07-20T14:26:51.903Z"
          },
